    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A town centre mixed use investment.\r\nComprising a ground floor retail unit together with 2 x flats overhead.\r\nExtending to approximately 124 sq. m (1,334 sq. ft) in total.\r\nLocated on Bailey's New Street in the centre of Waterford City centre.\r\nGround floor let an individual. \r\n2 year lease from 1st February 2024\r\n2 x flats are occupied.\r\nInformal tenancies.\r\nTotal current rent reserved 14,580 per annum.\r\n\r\nThe property is arranged over ground and two upper floors to provide a mid terraced mixed use building. Internally the property comprises a ground floor retail unit together with a two x flats at first and second floor level. The property is situated on Baileys New Street within the centre of Waterford City centre. Surrounding occupiers include Theatre Royal Waterford, The Tower Hotel & Leisure Centre, Dunnes Stores and City Square Shopping Centre.The property is centrally located with easy access to several nearby bus stops served by Bus Éireann and other operators, providing regular services across Waterford City and surrounding areas. Waterford (Plunkett) Train Station is located approximately 1km away and the N25 road provides access to regional routes towards Cork and Rosslare.Total floor area extending to approximately 124 sq. m (1,334 sq. ft)"
